{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55506","headline":"碧流院（题拟） · 杜棱","name":"碧流院（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石骨生泉冷，流来涧沼湄。\n幽禽鸣竹砌，游客步阶陲。\n滃郁杉松碧，阴稠烟霭缁。\n古风吟不足，嗟恨老苍髭。\n（见宋潜说友《咸淳临安志》卷八十五。\n）（按：碧流院，吴越王更名碧沼。\n此诗不详作年，题仍旧名。\n又棱约卒於乾宁、天复间，以其爲钱鏐佐属，故收归吴越。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜棱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}